{
  "handle": "custom-football-kit-prices",
  "content": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\n  \"name\": \"Custom Football Kit Prices 2026 — Jersey, Shorts, Full Kit | MOMUTO\",\n  \"description\": \"Custom football kit prices 2026: €38.90 for one jersey, €21.90 each at 10+, full kit from €21.90, worked totals for 11, 15 and 20 players. No minimum order.\",\n  \"url\": \"https://www.momuto.com/pages/custom-football-kit-prices\",\n  \"inLanguage\": \"en\",\n  \"breadcrumb\": {\n    \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n    \"itemListElement\": [\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n        \"position\": 1,\n        \"name\": \"Home\",\n        \"item\": \"https://www.momuto.com\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n        \"position\": 2,\n        \"name\": \"Custom Football Kit Prices\",\n        \"item\": \"https://www.momuto.com/pages/custom-football-kit-prices\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Product\",\n  \"name\": \"Jersey — MOMUTO\",\n  \"description\": \"Custom football kit prices 2026: €38.90 for one jersey, €21.90 each at 10+, full kit from €21.90, worked totals for 11, 15 and 20 players. No minimum order.\",\n  \"brand\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Brand\",\n    \"name\": \"MOMUTO\"\n  },\n  \"offers\": {\n    \"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\",\n    \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\",\n    \"lowPrice\": \"16.90\",\n    \"highPrice\": \"38.90\",\n    \"offerCount\": 7,\n    \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.momuto.com/pages/custom-football-kit-prices\",\n    \"offers\": [\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\",\n        \"price\": \"38.90\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.momuto.com/pages/custom-football-kit-prices\",\n        \"eligibleQuantity\": {\n          \"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\",\n          \"minValue\": 1,\n          \"maxValue\": 1,\n          \"unitText\": \"jersey\"\n        },\n        \"name\": \"Jersey · 1 unit\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\",\n        \"price\": \"34.90\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.momuto.com/pages/custom-football-kit-prices\",\n        \"eligibleQuantity\": {\n          \"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\",\n          \"minValue\": 2,\n          \"maxValue\": 4,\n          \"unitText\": \"jersey\"\n        },\n        \"name\": \"Jersey · 2–4 units\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\",\n        \"price\": \"26.90\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.momuto.com/pages/custom-football-kit-prices\",\n        \"eligibleQuantity\": {\n          \"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\",\n          \"minValue\": 5,\n          \"maxValue\": 9,\n          \"unitText\": \"jersey\"\n        },\n        \"name\": \"Jersey · 5–9 units\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\",\n        \"price\": \"21.90\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.momuto.com/pages/custom-football-kit-prices\",\n        \"eligibleQuantity\": {\n          \"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\",\n          \"minValue\": 10,\n          \"maxValue\": 19,\n          \"unitText\": \"jersey\"\n        },\n        \"name\": \"Jersey · 10–19 units\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\",\n        \"price\": \"18.90\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.momuto.com/pages/custom-football-kit-prices\",\n        \"eligibleQuantity\": {\n          \"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\",\n          \"minValue\": 20,\n          \"maxValue\": 49,\n          \"unitText\": \"jersey\"\n        },\n        \"name\": \"Jersey · 20–49 units\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\",\n        \"price\": \"17.90\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.momuto.com/pages/custom-football-kit-prices\",\n        \"eligibleQuantity\": {\n          \"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\",\n          \"minValue\": 50,\n          \"maxValue\": 99,\n          \"unitText\": \"jersey\"\n        },\n        \"name\": \"Jersey · 50–99 units\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n        \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\",\n        \"price\": \"16.90\",\n        \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.momuto.com/pages/custom-football-kit-prices\",\n        \"eligibleQuantity\": {\n          \"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\",\n          \"minValue\": 100,\n          \"unitText\": \"jersey\"\n        },\n        \"name\": \"Jersey · 100+ units\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How much does a custom football kit cost for a team of 15?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"At the 10–19 tier a jersey is €21.90 and a jersey + shorts kit is €26.90, so 15 jerseys cost €328.50 and 15 full kits €403.50, shipping included. Names and numbers are included; socks are €3.90 a pair if you add them.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is there a minimum order?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"No. One jersey is €38.90. The per-unit price falls at 2, 5, 10, 20, 50 and 100 units.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Are names, numbers and sponsor logos extra?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"No. They are sublimated into the fabric with the design and included in the price at every quantity.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What does design cost?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Designing in the 3D designer is free, with no account. A designer-built design (a brief, a sketch or an AI concept) takes a €15 deposit that is credited in full to orders of 5+ jerseys — free design for teams.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What about shipping and duties?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Shipping is free over €50 and €3.90 below. Delivery is tracked and duties are prepaid: 25–30 days door to door, or 18–23 with the fast lane (+€59 per order).\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Do prices differ between the 3D designer, Ready to Play and a bespoke design?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"No. One ladder for all three routes; the Ready to Play seasonal selection carries −10% on the designs wearing the badge.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" /><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\" /><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&amp;family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n<style>\n.title, .page-title { display: none !important; }\n:root { --bg:#0a0a0a; --panel:#111; --border:rgba(255,255,255,0.07); --white:#f5f5f5; --muted:#a1a1aa; --dim:#71717a; --red:#c8352e; --red-h:#e04038; --fd:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif; --fb:'Outfit',sans-serif; }\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\nbody{font-family:var(--fb);font-weight:300;background:var(--bg);color:var(--white);line-height:1.65;overflow-x:hidden}\nh1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--fd);font-weight:400;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.03em;line-height:1}\n.acc{color:var(--red)}\n.faqpage{margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw);margin-right:calc(50% - 50vw)}\n.wrap{max-width:1060px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem}\n.hero{padding:5rem 1.5rem 3.5rem;text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%,#1a1a1a 0%,var(--bg) 70%);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}\n.badge{background:rgba(200,53,46,.1);border:1px solid rgba(200,53,46,.18);color:var(--red);font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;padding:6px 14px;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:1.4rem}\n.h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4.2rem);max-width:880px;margin:0 auto 1.2rem}\n.sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:1rem;max-width:660px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center}\n.mo-editor-reset .sub{margin-inline:auto}\n.quick{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(170px,1fr));gap:14px;max-width:1060px;margin:2.4rem auto 0;padding:0 1.5rem;text-align:left}\n.mo-editor-reset .quick{margin-inline:auto}\n.q{background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:18px 20px}\n.q .k{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--white);line-height:1;letter-spacing:.02em}\n.q .l{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;line-height:1.5}\nnav.faqnav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;background:rgba(10,10,10,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}\nnav.faqnav ul{list-style:none !important;margin:0 auto !important;padding:0 1rem !important;max-width:1060px;display:flex !important;gap:.2rem;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none}\nnav.faqnav ul::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\nnav.faqnav li{list-style:none !important;display:block !important;flex-shrink:0}\nnav.faqnav li::marker{content:none}\nnav.faqnav a{display:block;padding:14px 12px;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;white-space:nowrap}\nnav.faqnav a:hover{color:var(--white);border-color:var(--red)}\n.sec{padding:3.5rem 0;scroll-margin-top:60px}\n.sec h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.4rem);margin-bottom:.4rem}\n.sec .lead{color:var(--muted);max-width:720px;margin:0 0 1.8rem;font-size:.95rem}\n.sec.alt{background:var(--panel);border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}\n.faq details{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)}\n.faq details:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)}\n.faq summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:18px 4px;font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:#fff;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px}\n.faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n.faq summary::after{content:'+';font-size:24px;color:var(--red);font-weight:300;line-height:1;flex-shrink:0}\n.faq details[open] summary::after{content:'\\2013'}\n.faq .a{margin:0 4px 18px;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;max-width:820px}\n.faq .a b{color:#e5e5e5;font-weight:600}\n.faq .a a{color:var(--white);border-bottom:1px solid var(--red);text-decoration:none}\n.tablewrap{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--panel)}\ntable.ladder{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px;font-size:.92rem}\ntable.ladder th{font-family:var(--fd);font-weight:400;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);text-align:left;padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}\ntable.ladder td{padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--white)}\ntable.ladder tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}\ntable.ladder td:first-child{color:var(--muted)}\ntable.ladder tr.pop td{background:rgba(200,53,46,.08);color:#fff;font-weight:600}\ntable.ladder .pill{display:inline-block;margin-left:8px;background:var(--red);color:#fff;font-size:.6rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 8px;vertical-align:middle}\nul.notes{list-style:none !important;margin:1.4rem 0 0 !important;padding:0 !important;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:10px 24px}\nul.notes > li{display:flex !important;list-style:none !important;gap:.6rem;align-items:flex-start;font-size:.86rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55}\nul.notes > li::marker{content:none}\nul.notes > li .ck{color:var(--red);font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0}\nul.notes b{color:#e5e5e5;font-weight:600}\n.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--red);color:#fff;padding:16px 40px;font-weight:700;font-size:.82rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--red);transition:all .2s}\n.btn:hover{background:var(--red-h);transform:translateY(-2px)}\n.btn2{display:inline-block;background:transparent;color:var(--white);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);padding:14px 34px;font-weight:600;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;transition:all .2s;margin-left:.6rem}\n.btn2:hover{border-color:var(--red);color:var(--red)}\n.cta-end{padding:4.5rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;background:var(--panel);border-top:1px solid var(--border)}\n.cta-end h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.8rem);margin-bottom:1rem}\n.cta-end p{color:var(--muted);max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 2rem;font-size:.95rem}\n.mo-editor-reset .cta-end p{margin-inline:auto}\n.more{padding:2.5rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--dim)}\n.more a{color:var(--muted)}\n@media(max-width:520px){.btn2{margin-left:0;margin-top:.8rem}}\n\n.hero .ctas{display:flex;gap:.8rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1.8rem}\ntable.ladder.ex td:nth-child(n+2){text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}\n.calc{background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:22px 24px;max-width:720px}\n.calc .row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;align-items:center;margin:0 0 12px}\n.calc label{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}\n.calc input[type=number],.calc select{background:#0b0b0c;color:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:8px 10px;font-family:var(--fb);font-size:1rem;width:110px}\n.calc select{width:auto}\n.calc .out{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:2.2rem;color:var(--white);line-height:1;margin-top:10px}\n.calc .out small{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-top:6px}\n.plink{margin-top:1.2rem;font-size:.88rem}.plink a{color:var(--white);border-bottom:1px solid var(--red);text-decoration:none}\n</style>\n<div class=\"faqpage\">\n<section class=\"hero\">\n<div class=\"badge\">Prices 2026</div>\n<h1 class=\"h1\">Custom Football Kit <span class=\"acc\">Prices</span></h1>\n<p class=\"sub\">One ladder for every design: the same price whether you build it in the free 3D designer, pick a Ready to Play design, or send us an AI concept. Names, numbers and sponsor logos are printed in at no extra cost. No minimum order.</p>\n<div class=\"ctas\"><a href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&amp;configId=ypi9qc1z&amp;suitName=mamuto3suit1&amp;lang=en&amp;langguage=en\" class=\"btn\">Open the 3D designer — free</a><a href=\"/pages/request-custom-kit-design\" class=\"btn2\">Request a design</a></div>\n<div class=\"quick\"><div class=\"q\"><div class=\"k\">€38.90</div><div class=\"l\">one jersey, no minimum</div></div><div class=\"q\"><div class=\"k\">€21.90</div><div class=\"l\">per jersey at 10+</div></div><div class=\"q\"><div class=\"k\">€26.90</div><div class=\"l\">jersey + shorts at 10+</div></div><div class=\"q\"><div class=\"k\">25–30 days</div><div class=\"l\">door to door, tracked</div></div></div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\" id=\"ladder\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<h2>The price ladder</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Per unit, per line. Quantities pool per product, so 12 jerseys and 12 shorts each get the 10–19 tier.</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\"><table class=\"ladder\">\n<thead><tr><th>Order size</th><th>Jersey</th><th>Shorts</th><th>Full kit (jersey + shorts)</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>1 unit</td><td>€38.90</td><td>€17.90</td><td>€56.80</td></tr>\n<tr><td>2–4 units</td><td>€34.90</td><td>€15.90</td><td>€50.80</td></tr>\n<tr><td>5–9 units</td><td>€26.90</td><td>€11.90</td><td>€38.80</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"pop\"><td>10–19 units<span class=\"pill\">Most popular</span></td><td>€21.90</td><td>€5.00</td><td>€26.90</td></tr>\n<tr><td>20–49 units</td><td>€18.90</td><td>€5.00</td><td>€23.90</td></tr>\n<tr><td>50–99 units</td><td>€17.90</td><td>€5.00</td><td>€22.90</td></tr>\n<tr><td>100+ units</td><td>€16.90</td><td>€5.00</td><td>€21.90</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec alt\" id=\"examples\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<h2>What a team actually pays</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Worked totals at the ladder price, shipping included (free over €50). Add-ons are optional and listed below.</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\"><table class=\"ladder ex\">\n<thead><tr><th>Team</th><th>Jerseys only</th><th>Per player</th><th>Jersey + shorts</th><th>Per player</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>11 players</td><td>€240.90</td><td>€21.90</td><td>€295.90</td><td>€26.90</td></tr>\n<tr><td>15 players</td><td>€328.50</td><td>€21.90</td><td>€403.50</td><td>€26.90</td></tr>\n<tr><td>20 players</td><td>€378.00</td><td>€18.90</td><td>€478.00</td><td>€23.90</td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\" id=\"addons\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<h2>Add-ons and the two extras people ask about</h2>\n<ul class=\"notes\">\n<li><span class=\"ck\">&check;</span><span><b>Per unit, per line.</b> Quantities pool per product: 12 jerseys + 12 shorts each get the 10–19 tier.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ck\">&check;</span><span><b>Ready to Play seasonal selection: −10%</b> on the designs wearing the badge — every season a rotating selection of finished designs.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ck\">&check;</span><span><b>Long sleeves: +€3.00 per jersey</b> at any quantity, chosen per player on the roster.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ck\">&check;</span><span><b>Polo collar: +€3.00 per jersey</b> at any quantity, when your design has one — ask for it when you request the design.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ck\">&check;</span><span><b>Socks: €3.90</b> per pair, flat at any quantity. Optional, per player. Not custom-printed — a plain matching team sock, available in most colours.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ck\">&check;</span><span><b>Free shipping over €50.</b> Under that, shipping is €3.90.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ck\">&check;</span><span><b>Fast lane: +€59 per order</b> skips the production queue and adds shipping priority — saves roughly 7 days.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ck\">&check;</span><span><b>Custom design deposit: €15</b> for a designer-built (bespoke or AI-concept) design — credited in full to orders of 5+ jerseys, so free for a team order. Designing in the 3D designer is always free.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ck\">&check;</span><span><b>Free team flag + captain armband</b> with orders of 10 or more kits (jersey + shorts). Not included with jersey-only orders.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec alt\" id=\"calculator\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<h2>Price your own order</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">The same ladder, for your numbers. Nothing is sent; this is arithmetic in your browser.</p>\n<div class=\"calc\" id=\"mo-price-calc\" data-ladder='{\"rows\":[{\"min\":1,\"max\":1,\"jersey\":38.9,\"kit\":56.8},{\"min\":2,\"max\":4,\"jersey\":34.9,\"kit\":50.8},{\"min\":5,\"max\":9,\"jersey\":26.9,\"kit\":38.8},{\"min\":10,\"max\":19,\"jersey\":21.9,\"kit\":26.9},{\"min\":20,\"max\":49,\"jersey\":18.9,\"kit\":23.9},{\"min\":50,\"max\":99,\"jersey\":17.9,\"kit\":22.9},{\"min\":100,\"max\":1000000000,\"jersey\":16.9,\"kit\":21.9}],\"socks\":3.9,\"ls\":3,\"fast\":59,\"freeOver\":50,\"fee\":3.9,\"cur\":\"€\",\"after\":false,\"dec\":\".\"}' data-per=\"per player\" data-ship=\"Shipping\">\n<div class=\"row\"><label>Players <input type=\"number\" id=\"mo-n\" min=\"1\" max=\"999\" value=\"15\"></label>\n<label>What <select id=\"mo-item\"><option value=\"jersey\">Jersey</option><option value=\"kit\" selected>Jersey + shorts</option></select></label></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"mo-socks\"> Socks (+€3.90 per pair)</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"mo-ls\"> Long sleeves (+€3.00 per jersey)</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"mo-fast\"> Fast lane (+€59 per order)</label></div>\n<div class=\"out\"><span id=\"mo-total\">—</span><small>Order total · <span id=\"mo-per\"></span></small></div>\n</div>\n<script>(function(){var el=document.getElementById('mo-price-calc');if(!el)return;var D=JSON.parse(el.getAttribute('data-ladder'));var q=function(s){return el.querySelector(s)};\nfunction f(v){var s=v.toFixed(2);if(D.dec===','){s=s.replace('.',',');}return D.after?s+' '+D.cur:D.cur+s}\nfunction tier(n){for(var i=0;i<D.rows.length;i++){if(n>=D.rows[i].min&&n<=D.rows[i].max)return D.rows[i]}return D.rows[D.rows.length-1]}\nfunction run(){var n=Math.max(1,Math.min(999,parseInt(q('#mo-n').value,10)||1));var t=tier(n);var kit=q('#mo-item').value==='kit';var unit=kit?t.kit:t.jersey;var sub=n*unit;if(q('#mo-ls').checked)sub+=n*D.ls;if(q('#mo-socks').checked)sub+=n*D.socks;var sh=sub>=D.freeOver?0:D.fee;var fast=q('#mo-fast').checked?D.fast:0;var total=sub+sh+fast;\nq('#mo-total').textContent=f(total);q('#mo-per').textContent=f(total/n)+' '+el.getAttribute('data-per')+' · '+el.getAttribute('data-ship')+' '+(sh?f(sh):'0')}\n['change','input','keyup'].forEach(function(e){el.addEventListener(e,run)});run()})();</script>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"sec\" id=\"questions\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<h2>Price questions</h2>\n<div class=\"faq\">\n<details><summary>How much does a custom football kit cost for a team of 15?</summary><div class=\"a\"><p>At the 10–19 tier a jersey is €21.90 and a jersey + shorts kit is €26.90, so 15 jerseys cost €328.50 and 15 full kits €403.50, shipping included. Names and numbers are included; socks are €3.90 a pair if you add them.</p></div></details>\n<details><summary>Is there a minimum order?</summary><div class=\"a\"><p>No. One jersey is €38.90. The per-unit price falls at 2, 5, 10, 20, 50 and 100 units.</p></div></details>\n<details><summary>Are names, numbers and sponsor logos extra?</summary><div class=\"a\"><p>No. They are sublimated into the fabric with the design and included in the price at every quantity.</p></div></details>\n<details><summary>What does design cost?</summary><div class=\"a\"><p>Designing in the 3D designer is free, with no account. A designer-built design (a brief, a sketch or an AI concept) takes a €15 deposit that is credited in full to orders of 5+ jerseys — free design for teams.</p></div></details>\n<details><summary>What about shipping and duties?</summary><div class=\"a\"><p>Shipping is free over €50 and €3.90 below. Delivery is tracked and duties are prepaid: 25–30 days door to door, or 18–23 with the fast lane (+€59 per order).</p></div></details>\n<details><summary>Do prices differ between the 3D designer, Ready to Play and a bespoke design?</summary><div class=\"a\"><p>No. One ladder for all three routes; the Ready to Play seasonal selection carries −10% on the designs wearing the badge.</p></div></details>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"cta-end\">\n<h2>Design it, then see the price in the tool</h2>\n<p>Open the free 3D designer, set the quantity and the ladder price shows before you pay anything.</p>\n<a href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&amp;configId=ypi9qc1z&amp;suitName=mamuto3suit1&amp;lang=en&amp;langguage=en\" class=\"btn\">Open the 3D designer — free</a>\n<a href=\"/pages/request-custom-kit-design\" class=\"btn2\">Request a design</a>\n</section>\n<div class=\"more\">Keep exploring: <a href=\"/pages/jersey-maker\">jersey maker</a> &middot; <a href=\"/pages/faq\">FAQ</a> &middot; <a href=\"/pages/shipping-policy\">shipping</a> &middot; <a href=\"/pages/custom-soccer-jerseys\">custom football kits</a></div>\n</div>\n",
